      "message": "More of a curiosity / question (as clearly this hasn\u0027t been an issue before):\n\nWhile reading the table_free_if_unused() and _owned_prefixes() I also noticed that route_del() will always call the unicast variant, and never the multicast variant. I wonder do we delete mcast routes properly?\n\nroute_add() is using mfib_table_entry_update / mfib_table_entry_paths_update with MFIB_SOURCE_PLUGIN_LOW.\n\nShouldn\u0027t this have a branch on type\u003d\u003dRTN_MLUTICAST and if so, call mfib_table_entry_paths_remove() instead?",
